  partName: Middle Front Heat Shield
  description: The Middle Front Heat Shield is a tiny, thin-flat shield positioned
    at the middle-center-front of the engine, made of Material.004, which protects
    surrounding components from excessive heat generated by the engine. This heat
    shield is essential for maintaining the engine's reliability and performance,
    and an interesting detail is that it often features a specialized coating to
    reflect or dissipate heat. The Middle Front Heat Shield plays a critical role
    in preventing overheating and damage to nearby components.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
